      datenschutz: '<p><em>この法的情報はドイツ語と英語で用意されています。以下は英語版です。</em></p><h3>In short</h3><p>Lucenta has no server. Your answers, your result, your history, your check-ins and your profile never leave your device &ndash; except to your own iCloud if you choose to sign in with Apple (see below). There is no account with us, no advertising, no tracking and nothing passed to third parties.</p><h3>Sign in with Apple (optional)</h3><p>If you sign in with Apple, Lucenta also backs up your data in your own private iCloud (Apple CloudKit), end-to-end encrypted. We receive neither your name nor your email address, only a random identifier that stays on your device. Only you and your Apple Account can access this data, not us. You can sign out any time in Settings; “Delete sign-in and iCloud data” there also deletes the backup in your iCloud.</p><h3>Apple Health (optional)</h3><p>If you turn on the Health option in the settings, Lucenta adds the mood of each check-in to Apple Health on your device as a state of mind. Lucenta does not read any data from Health. None of it is transferred to us or to third parties or used for advertising. You can revoke the permission in Health at any time.</p><h3>Controller</h3><p>{{name}}, {{strasse}}, {{ort}} &mdash; email: {{email}}</p><h3>What is stored on your device</h3><ul><li><code>lucenta_result</code> &mdash; your last result (five numbers)</li><li><code>lucenta_history</code> &mdash; up to twelve earlier results with dates</li><li><code>lucenta_state</code> &mdash; up to 150 entries on energy and mood, each with date and time of day</li><li><code>lucenta_profile</code> &mdash; name, chosen figure, colour and a picture you chose</li><li><code>lucenta_compat_archive</code> &mdash; up to 20 saved comparisons</li><li><code>lucenta_freunde</code> &mdash; 名前・キャラクター・コード付きで保存した友だち（最大 30 人）</li><li><code>lucenta_progress</code> &mdash; one interrupted test run</li><li>settings for appearance, language, haptics and motion</li></ul><p>All of this lives in your device&rsquo;s local storage &ndash; and, if you sign in with Apple, encrypted in your own iCloud as well. None of it is transmitted to us or to anyone else at any point. You can delete it yourself at any time under Settings &rarr; Data &amp; privacy &rarr; &ldquo;Reset my data&rdquo;, or by deleting Lucenta from your device.</p><h3>Fonts</h3><p>The fonts are part of the file itself. Nothing is fetched when you open the app, and there is no connection to Google Fonts or any other third party. Fraunces, Work Sans and IBM Plex Mono are used under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.</p><h3>Your rights</h3><p>You have the rights to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection (Art. 15 to 21 GDPR), as well as the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority. Because we store no personal data about you, we can neither provide information about your content nor delete it &mdash; it exists only on your device.</p><h3>Changes</h3><p>Version of this statement: {{stand}}.</p>'
